.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH rayscan-diff 1  "diff " 
.SH NAME
rayscan\-diff \- Compare two previous scan reports or state files to display differences
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBdiff\fR [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-\-fail\-on\-change\fR] [\fB\-\-alert\-file\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIBASELINE_FILE\fR> <\fICURRENT_FILE\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Compare two previous scan reports or state files to display differences
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Output differences in JSON format
.TP
\fB\-\-fail\-on\-change\fR
Exit with status 1 when any change is detected
.TP
\fB\-\-alert\-file\fR \fI<FILE>\fR
Write a concise change alert to FILE (written on every run)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIBASELINE_FILE\fR>
Baseline report: rayscan JSON, state file, or Nmap XML
.TP
<\fICURRENT_FILE\fR>
Current report: rayscan JSON, state file, or Nmap XML
